  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b64c1c05fbca5974907de19",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "收到大家寄来的贺年卡了！\r\n看来姐姐她们好像也过得很好……\r\n让我新年一早就得到了鼓励呢──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09ceb0530a503115e7f7409175b1b42e49fb43753eafe20a24323f2335395d28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c282353bb659661eb010ebf7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来想做包饭的巧克力来表达谢意，\r\n结果却失败了……！所以只能给你\r\n普通的巧克力了，对不起！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86286c1c1ad4e1b32fb17d1604c656ce8a2ade00885894d10db6d72829cb491f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a6214a22f389e1549ed431e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了表示谢意及答谢你平时的照顾，\r\n我做了巧克力……唔啊啊，说出口\r\n好害羞……唔哦哦！别看我啦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b050f1eeda02085cfadb5ee4c8d06dd2cd57c760242a1c6882410123783cb27a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b851fccc453dcbeb04d0e142",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼啊……昨天晚上我做了\r\n100个晴天娃娃……但想要\r\n看到银河，这样是不是还不够──？",
      "source_fingerprint": "292d0f59ff2793dacd4ad4eaf159fc6fc1fcf370618716a031e42551ceef9795",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d97fbfd5f3a816eea2b9ee34",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我根本不会恶作剧来着，\r\n结果还是收到了好多的点心！\r\n呜喔喔！大家人都好好喔──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5430788f77386348ee94e7b4370565085394cb2e4011b1b1e758b56f96b5a4be",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b696c93c2dc27b3d2d88eed3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣诞快乐！嘿嘿，训练员也一起\r\n享受圣诞节嘛──！因为今天是\r\n大家都会收到幸福的日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea0990394d89af268b0149035eda826f7e37d09f2482b8b911b8a29ee2540b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015feea748f039c472b678b5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员如果当个乖孩子，\r\n圣诞老人就可能会来哦？\r\n别担心，我都已经准备好……啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85277387dc524df0968ec4fc517cf6ab7fa53c234d52e0cd5c2eee588f023e8c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e669513c391568aea6670b7",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成功啦────！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b88f7bc1a4c63d69d6b5de0dbaf92be98b35d2b194117c1d9e4cea5c50f5311",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "1001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/1001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ca48ad37c59266145cbd4e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "人家说吃跨年荞麦面\r\n就会健康长寿诶！！\r\n好啊，我要努力吃一百碗！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57e1f452eccfe34c27d1355706eb5a25038cafda48f4daf5ac159a5a46bd796",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1755c08f3b745bf908adbb4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐──！\r\n从今以后！无论过多少年！\r\n我们都要一直一直～一起努力哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5c515c45799fbe82f19221b7a5ee49946fe3a8a57240515e55c5f9b2ec93e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:606177723e1f0f663e62f5fe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "已经是大人的训练员\r\n也曾经是小孩子对吧？\r\n嘿嘿，有点想看你小时候的样子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4bd0f53c402f4e63d6193525382b34c80faba9458842b9fca977bfe80e8b70f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08f6df416df8c5ec18867d8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天是我的生日哦！\r\n要记住3・2・1……Go这样哦！\r\n我们的暗号是「Go」哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe042f4407cb06730231f6e45d92ca051c5c53ef7d78e9e49b00b0ddd3fcaed7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be56534ad8aa0b0125010e06",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，连训练员也帮我庆生……\r\n呜喔喔～！！\r\n我能生在这世上真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f411f42c7930764f5c28b104c9ba90d8ff9ea7674467477592e44f7d9806ef75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b52bad330e9e04770eae3e76",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员、训练员！\r\n好像有什么新公告呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec65975c2bf402d6f74778d35fcb9a024c6747bc010f09cde55af9d47f5fa176",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb2dfefa4aee20d291396bfe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂喂，好像说有礼物诶！\r\n可以让我来拆吗！？好不好！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02748cdfb911b9dfbe36e99222474617718e9401bc03e695c5021d83674f157",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10016"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10016"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a19f38b6f545678f9ddbdc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哦哦！恭喜训练员达成目标──！\r\n万岁──万岁──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2aa68f7d6d320264cf6d64571efca0aac35cedb23b0ed3306175163bc78d85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10017"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10017"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece5f8c17e73b51d0eb16fb3",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听说正在准备要举办活动呢！\r\n嗯～好期待哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "054896111e425e260aaa606ef34ab418b2960ed1b2cceddef999a4b123f7833a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1035",
        "10018"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1035/10018"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16cb700687c2e352a864e784",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好像正在办什么有趣的事情诶！\r\n我们也去看看嘛！快点快点！\r\n不赶快去的话，说不定要结束了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7543344e5fff0df8de49684d352571598e504e8d557c8c2465f8e4b8b44953f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
